{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50255","headline":"马明生遇王婉罗 · 李翔","name":"马明生遇王婉罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彻骨金疮分已休，谢神妃护到灵丘。\n供丞（承）洞府知何地，洒扫云房不记秋。\n金锁玉函虽照燿，宝书真篆敢规（窥）求。\n龙胎未肯传初学，又逐安期万里游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}